<title>ROMANIA: FRANCE'S CHIRAC ARRIVES FOR STATE VISIT.</title>
<headline>FRANCE'S CHIRAC ARRIVES FOR STATE VISIT.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>French President Jacques Chirac arrived in Romania on Friday for a two-day state visit, state radio said in a live broadcast.</p>
<p>Chirac was met at Otopeni airport by President Emil Constantinescu and greeted by a 21-gun salute.</p>
<p>He was to be officially welcomed at the city's Arch of Triumph, a smaller version of the Paris monument, where several thousand well-wishers were awaiting his arrival.</p>
